sor upstream of SCR – implausible","what":"The NOx reading before SCR does not match the DDE model.","check":"Workshop: diagnose NOx sensor; also check for exhaust leaks."},"sources":["https://static.nhtsa.gov/odi/tsbs/2019/MC-10163035-9999.pdf"],"confidence":"high"},{"address":"12","code":"26F500","unit":"DME/DDE engine","engines":["N47","N57"],"severity":"workshop","pl":{"title":"SCR – zbyt niska skuteczność","what":"Układ SCR (AdBlue) redukuje NOx słabiej niż wymagane. Przy dłuższym występowaniu system odlicza starty do blokady.","check":"Sprawdź poziom AdBlue i czy tankujesz właściwy płyn. Warsztat: adaptacja SCR, dozownik i czujniki NOx."},"en":{"title":"SCR – efficiency too low","what":"The SCR (AdBlue) system reduces NOx less than required. If it persists the car counts down starts to a lockout.","check":"Check AdBlue level and that the correct fluid is used. Workshop: SCR adaptation, dosing valve and NOx sensors."},"sources":["https://static.nhtsa.gov/odi/tsbs/2014/MC-10148114-9999.pdf"],"confidence":"high"},{"address":"12","code":"273B00","unit":"DME/DDE engine","engines":["B57"],"severity":"workshop","pl":{"title":"Czujnik wałka rozrządu – brak sygnału (diesel)","what":"DDE traci sygnał z czujnika wałka rozrządu. Może zaburzyć adaptacje wtryskiwaczy.","check":"Warsztat: czujnik wałka, złącze i wiązka; dopiero potem ocena wtryskiwaczy."},"en":{"title":"Camshaft sensor – signal failure (diesel)","what":"The DDE loses the camshaft sensor signal. It can upset injector adaptations.","check":"Workshop: camshaft sensor, connector and harness; assess injectors only afterwards."},"sources":["https://static.nhtsa.gov/odi/tsbs/2018/MC-10138378-9999.pdf"],"confidence":"high"},{"address":"12","code":"275800","unit":"DME/DDE engine","engines":["B57"],"severity":"workshop","pl":{"title":"Czujnik wału korbowego – brak sygnału (diesel)","what":"DDE traci sygnał z czujnika wału. Możliwa nierówna praca na biegu jałowym i przy przyspieszaniu.","check":"Warsztat: czujnik wału,