ilku minutach.","check":"Jeśli ekran gaśnie – warsztat. Ten wpis wskazuje sprzęt, nie oprogramowanie."},"en":{"title":"CID screen – hardware fault","what":"The central display reports a hardware fault (backlight or checksum). On G05/G07 the screen went dark after minutes.","check":"If the screen goes dark – workshop. This entry points to hardware, not software."},"sources":["https://static.nhtsa.gov/odi/tsbs/2019/MC-10153772-9999.pdf"],"confidence":"medium"},{"address":"63","code":"B7F8F9","unit":"Head unit","engines":[],"severity":"watch","pl":{"title":"HU-H3 (MGU) – reset przez watchdog","what":"Jednostka MGU w modelach G restartuje się przez nadzór oprogramowania.","check":"Częste restarty – warsztat: aktualizacja oprogramowania pojazdu."},"en":{"title":"HU-H3 (MGU) – watchdog reset","what":"The MGU unit in G models restarts due to software supervision.","check":"Frequent restarts – workshop: vehicle software update."},"sources":["https://static.nhtsa.gov/odi/tsbs/2020/MC-10184588-9999.pdf","https://static.nhtsa.gov/odi/tsbs/2021/MC-10205070-9999.pdf"],"confidence":"high"},{"address":"63","code":"E1C440","unit":"Head unit","engines":[],"severity":"watch","pl":{"title":"Reset jednostki głównej","what":"Jednostka główna zrestartowała się (nawigacja/radio zniknęły na chwilę).","check":"Pojedynczy wpis – obserwuj. Częste resety – warsztat: oprogramowanie, podłączone urządzenia USB."},"en":{"title":"Head unit reset","what":"The head unit restarted (navigation/radio went away briefly).","check":"Single entry – watch. Frequent resets – workshop: software, connected USB devices."},"sources":["https://static.nhtsa.gov/odi/tsbs/2016/MC-10146794-9999.pdf","https://static.nhtsa.gov/odi/tsbs/2016/MC-10151025-9999.pdf"],"confidence":"high"},{"address":"64","code":"803200","unit":"PDC park sensors","engines":[],"severity":"workshop","pl":{"title":"Zasilanie czujników parkowania","what":"Obwód zasilania czujników ultradźwiękowych ma usterkę – czujniki z przodu i/lub z tyłu nie d